{
 "netpack": 1,
 "name": "big_roundabout",
 "version": "0.1.0",
 "author": "netmod (task bigrbt)",
 "description": "Automatic 3x3 roundabouts: draw a 3x3 square of road cells with roads or avenues leaving it (at most two per side: an avenue on two neighbouring cells, or two single roads on the outer cells) and sc3netmod's RBT9 block turns it into one big roundabout: circular grass island, one-lane ring running counter-clockwise, give-way lines at the entries, avenue medians ending in a nose at the ring. 14 pieces (20600 centre, 20601..20604 side cells, 20610..20618 corner cells by their arms), all painted from stock road 29's frames by `bigrbt.py build .` in this folder before install (art/ is made from the game's frames and is not shipped). Lanes: stock curves only. A game without the mod opens the block as stock 43 / 39 / 11203 road.",
